# ============================================================================
# Grant to Policy Project — CODE ONLY (data intentionally deferred)
# Tracks scripts + docs; excludes all data/binary (~38GB) and archives.
# A data-handling decision (LFS / external store / regenerate) comes later.
# ============================================================================

# ---- OS / IDE / R session state ----
.DS_Store
.RData
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
**/.Rproj.user/

# ---- large data directories (deferred) ----
_archive/
_frozen_megafile_jun30/
**/Overton_20260305/
**/_cache/
**/_eric_download/
**/big_raw/
WWC-export-archive-*/

# ---- generated HTML-widget sidecar folders (vendored jquery/plotly/css) ----
**/*_files/
*.corrupted*

# ---- data & binary outputs (regenerable by the scripts) ----
*.csv
*.tsv
*.rds
*.rda
*.RData
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.zip
*.gz
*.parquet
*.html

# ---- curated PUBLIC data for GitHub release ----
# Everything above ignores data by extension (code-only policy). Re-include the
# vetted, Overton-free public data folder so it CAN be committed. This folder is
# the only data allowed into the repo; the raw Overton dump and the full
# megafiles/master files remain ignored above and must never be committed.
!public_data_github/
!public_data_github/**
